      "content": "Those are good starting points, but they're a bit abstract. For the training to be effective, my associates need to be able to recognize these people the moment they walk through the door. Can you expand on these profiles? I'm looking for more concrete physical or behavioral cues—like how they dress, their general vibe, or even their background—that would signal to a staff member that they need to increase their vigilance or be extra careful about loss prevention and de-escalation tactics.",
